summary:
  The ease is two seconds long.

history:
  Ten decibels in two seconds are an event: the listener hears the radio
  drop, some twenty seconds into a station. Over eight they are 1.25 dB a
  second.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
  var EASE_MS = 8000;

replace:
  var EASE_MS = 2000;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudness.qml::test_a_reading_that_arrives_under_a_listener_is_eased_in.
  Line-neutral.
